[I] KIO worker for accessing audio CDs

[T] KIO AudioCD is a KIO worker that enables KIO-aware applications such as
[T] Dolphin or K3b to access audio and CD text data on audio compact discs.
[T] It allows transparent drag and drop conversion of tracks into popular
[T] formats and includes a System Settings module.

[U] https://www.kde.org

